<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_log__base_8hpp">glm/gtx/log_base.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Logarithm for any base. base can be a vector or a scalar.</para>
</section>
